# Initial Setup's Compass page, ported from GCSViews/ConfigurationView/ConfigHWCompass2.cs - the page
# the list offers a vehicle with COMPASS_PRIO1_ID, ArduPilot 4.1 and later (InitialSetup.cs:200-207).
#
# The claims: Activate builds the priority table from COMPASS_PRIO1_ID..3_ID then every other nonzero
# COMPASS_DEV_IDn, each id decoded as Device.cs decodes it (ConfigHWCompass2.cs:86-145); a Use box is
# a MavlinkCheckBox that writes COMPASS_USE when clicked and the vehicle echoes it; Start sends
# DO_START_MAG_CAL 0,1,1 and the timer fills the text box from MAG_CAL_PROGRESS; Accept and Cancel
# send their commands and stop the timer (:264-356); Large Vehicle MagCal asks for a heading first
# (:476-498); Up writes the first three rows as COMPASS_PRIOn_ID and leaves a reboot required, which
# leaving the page asks about (:147-262).
#
# SITL cannot finish a calibration: it completes one only while the airframe is rotated through every
# orientation, and the simulated vehicle sits still, so completion stays at 0%. This script Starts,
# sees the progress messages arrive, Accepts - which ArduPilot refuses while sampling, and which stops
# the timer all the same - Starts again and Cancels. It never sends Large Vehicle MagCal (that would
# rewrite the SITL's offsets) and never reboots: the reboot question is answered No.
#
# Needs SITL copter on tcp:127.0.0.1:5760 started from tools/sitl/params/copter.parm, whose compasses
# are the firmware's SITL defaults: COMPASS_DEV_ID 97539 (DroneCAN, node 125), DEV_ID2 131874 (SPI 4,
# LSM303D), DEV_ID3 263178 (SPI 1, AK8963), DEV_ID4-6 97283, 97795, 98051, PRIO1-3 the first three,
# COMPASS_EXTERNAL 1, COMPASS_USE 1, COMPASS_LEARN 0, COMPASS_CAL_FIT 16. Run as
#
#   tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/config-compass.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760
#
# It ends where it started. A run that stops half way can leave COMPASS_USE 0 or the first two
# priorities swapped; restoring them by hand, or a fresh SITL, puts them back. With the priorities
# swapped ArduPilot refuses a calibration ("Compass cal requires reboot after priority change").

screen params
window 1600x1200
settle 6
# RawParamWarning, on the Full Parameter List's Activate (ConfigRawParams.cs:92): "Show me
# again?" unticked, so no later visit asks, and OK.
click raw-param-warning-again
click raw-param-warning-ok

# The page is listed once every parameter is in (isConnected && gotAllParams).
click param-download
settle 15
expect params.held > 1000
expect params.value.COMPASS_USE 1
expect params.value.COMPASS_PRIO1_ID 97539

click tab-setup
settle 1
expect config.compass.active false
click setup-page-ConfigMandatory
click setup-page-ConfigHWCompass2
settle 2
expect setup.page ConfigHWCompass2
expect config.compass.active true
expect config.compass.class ConfigHWCompass2

# The table: the three priorities, then the other three devices, each decoded.
expect config.compass.rows 6
expect config.compass.devids 97539,131874,263178,97283,97795,98051
expect config.compass.row.1 1 97539 UAVCAN 0 125 SENSOR_ID#1 false true None
expect config.compass.row.2 2 131874 SPI 4 3 LSM303D false false None
expect config.compass.row.3 3 263178 SPI 1 4 AK8963 false false None
expect config.compass.row.4 ~ 4 97283 UAVCAN 0 124 SENSOR_ID#1 false false
expect config.compass.missing false
expect config.compass.dialog none
expect config.compass.orientations > 40

# The boxes and the fitness combo, as the vehicle holds them.
expect config.compass.use1 checked
expect config.compass.use1.enabled true
expect config.compass.use2 checked
expect config.compass.use3 checked
expect config.compass.learn unchecked
expect config.compass.fitness 16
expect config.compass.fitness.text Default
expect config.compass.rebootrequired false

# Use Compass 1 off - written, echoed - and back on.
click compass-use1
settle 3
expect config.compass.use1 unchecked
expect config.compass.write COMPASS_USE accepted
expect params.value.COMPASS_USE 0
expect config.compass.dialog none
click compass-use1
settle 3
expect config.compass.use1 checked
expect config.compass.write COMPASS_USE accepted
expect params.value.COMPASS_USE 1

# The calibration group before Start: Accept and Cancel disabled, the timer stopped.
expect config.compass.accept.enabled false
expect config.compass.cancel.enabled false
expect config.compass.cal.timer stopped

# Start: accepted, the buttons enabled, the timer running, and the progress messages in the text box.
click compass-cal-start
settle 3
expect config.compass.command DO_START_MAG_CAL accepted
expect config.compass.cal.timer running
expect config.compass.accept.enabled true
expect config.compass.cancel.enabled true
expect config.compass.cal.progress ~ id:0 0%
expect config.compass.cal.progress ~ id:1 0%
expect config.compass.cal.progress ~ id:2 0%
expect config.compass.cal.bars 0,0,0
expect config.compass.dialog none

# Accept while sampling: ArduPilot refuses it, the C# says nothing, and the timer stops.
click compass-cal-accept
settle 3
expect config.compass.command DO_ACCEPT_MAG_CAL refused
expect config.compass.cal.timer stopped
expect config.compass.dialog none

# Start again, then Cancel: accepted, the timer stopped, Accept and Cancel still enabled as the C#
# leaves them.
click compass-cal-start
settle 3
expect config.compass.command DO_START_MAG_CAL accepted
expect config.compass.cal.timer running
expect config.compass.cal.progress ~ id:0 0%
click compass-cal-cancel
settle 3
expect config.compass.command DO_CANCEL_MAG_CAL accepted
expect config.compass.cal.timer stopped
expect config.compass.cancel.enabled true
expect config.compass.dialog none

# Large Vehicle MagCal asks for the heading; Cancel sends nothing.
click compass-largemagcal
settle 1
expect config.compass.dialog ~ Enter current heading in degrees
click compass-dialog-cancel
settle 1
expect config.compass.dialog none
expect config.compass.command DO_CANCEL_MAG_CAL accepted
# OK on a heading that is no number sends nothing either - double.Parse throws first - but the
# box has kept the answer, as InputBox keeps every titled answer (InputBox.cs:73-84, 178-184).
click compass-largemagcal
settle 1
click compass-dialog-value
key ctrl+u
type north
click compass-dialog-ok
settle 1
expect config.compass.dialog none
expect config.compass.command DO_CANCEL_MAG_CAL accepted
expect config.InputBoxMagCalYawEntercurrentheadingindegreesNOTEgpslockisrequiredHeadingistruenotmagnetic north

# Up on the second compass: the first two swap and the first three are written as the priorities.
click compass-row-2-up
settle 4
expect config.compass.devids 131874,97539,263178,97283,97795,98051
expect config.compass.jobs 0
expect params.value.COMPASS_PRIO1_ID 131874
expect params.value.COMPASS_PRIO2_ID 97539
expect params.value.COMPASS_PRIO3_ID 263178
expect config.compass.rebootrequired true
expect config.compass.dialog none

# And back.
click compass-row-2-up
settle 4
expect config.compass.devids 97539,131874,263178,97283,97795,98051
expect params.value.COMPASS_PRIO1_ID 97539
expect params.value.COMPASS_PRIO2_ID 131874
expect config.compass.write COMPASS_PRIO3_ID accepted

# Leaving the page runs Deactivate, whose CheckReboot asks; No leaves the vehicle as it is.
click setup-page-ConfigMandatory
settle 1
expect config.compass.active false
expect config.compass.dialog Reboot required, reboot now?
click compass-dialog-cancel
settle 1
expect config.compass.dialog none
expect params.value.COMPASS_USE 1
expect params.value.COMPASS_PRIO1_ID 97539
